OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'no closer' to truth over
OL,4,ABBC worker death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe brother of a BBC charity worker who
OL,7,Fwas killed while working in Kenya has
OL,8,Fexpressed frustration at further delays
OL,9,Fto her inquest there.
OL,11,FKate Mitchell, 42, and originally from
OL,12,FWhitley Bay, North Tyneside, was
OL,13,Fworking for BBC Media Action when she
OL,14,Fwas found dead in her hotel room in
OL,15,FNairobi in November 2021.
OL,17,FAn inquest held in the UK ruled she had
OL,18,Fbeen unlawfully killed. A Kenyan
OL,19,Finquest has been taking place since
OL,20,Flast year but has been repeatedly
OL,21,Fdelayed.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
