OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'no closer' to truth over
OL,4,ABBC worker death
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing an inquest hearing earlier,
OL,7,FPeter Mitchell said they were "no
OL,8,Fcloser to finding out what happened"
OL,9,Fafter four of eight people listed to
OL,10,Fappear failed to give evidence.
